{%- comment -%}
  cart-count.liquid — the bubble on the header cart button.

  Always rendered, even at zero, and positioned absolutely over the icon, so
  adding the first item never changes the header's layout. Hidden from
  assistive tech because the button's own aria-label already carries the
  count as a sentence.

  Params: none.
{%- endcomment -%}

<span
  class="cart-count{% if cart.item_count == 0 %} cart-count--empty{% endif %}"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  {{- cart.item_count -}}
</span>
